{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53170","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 行满","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异域乡音别，观心法性同。\n来时求半偈，去罢悟真空。\n贝叶翻经疏，归程大海东。\n何当到本国，继踵大师风。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"行满","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}